===Pronunciation===
* [[w:X-Sampa|X-Sampa]]: /hi:bi:dZ)i:bi:z/

===Noun===
{{en-noun|''[[plurale tantum|always plural]]''}}
# {{context|US|idiom}} A general feeling of [[anxiety]], [[fear]], [[uneasiness]], or [[nausea]].
#:''I don't mind worms, but spiders give me the '''heebie-jeebies'''.''

